				\begin{document}$$\dot{\text {V}}$$\end{document}V˙O2 (Table 2). Tabd became higher in the middle of the dark phase in the OVX + E2 rats, which may have reflected lower Ttail (i.e., attenuated heat loss). Although no statistical difference in the amplitude of \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
